            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "WiseStir1842"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Well, sort of. I had to improvise. Used pancake syrup because I didn't have pure maple syrup. Also added 3 Tbs butter, 1 tsp nutmeg, and 1/2 tsp allspice. Melted the butter, mixed in the syrup with the dry ingredients. Painted generously on my ham. Delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-28T16:46:59.381Z"
          },
          {
