              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paula Doughton"
            },
            "reviewBody": "SOOOO GOOD! I made this glaze for Christmas. I cut the bottom off of the ham, poured the glaze over the ham, cooked on high in the crockpot for hours. The ham, was fall off the bone soft and extremely yummy. Next time, I need to make more glaze to pour over mashed potatoes.",
